OL,3,BFinland's president, spouse to join    
OL,4,BEnglish-language Moomin reading        
OL,5,Bmarathon                               
OL,6,GThe event will feature participants    
OL,7,Greading aloud from Tove Jansson's novel
OL,8,GComet in Moominland, starting from 7pm 
OL,9,GFinnish time on Friday 27 November.    
OL,10,K                                       
OL,11,BReport: Median monthly salary in       
OL,12,BFinland is E3,700   but gender gap     
OL,13,Bremains wide                           
OL,14,GThe highest earners in Finland are     
OL,15,Gmiddle-aged men, and women in full-time
OL,16,Gemployment earn almost 500 euros less  
OL,17,Gthan their male counterparts.          
