OL,1,D]GYLE NEWS             WEDNESDAY   2/2 
OL,2,K                                       
OL,3,BPolar night begins in Finland's        
OL,4,Bnorthernmost municipality              
OL,5,GThe sun will next rise in Utsjoki on 17
OL,6,GJanuary.                               
OL,7,K                                       
OL,8,BLahti school breaks Finnish law with 8-
OL,9,Bhour day for seventh-graders           
OL,10,GSome 13-year-old students at the school
OL,11,Ghad eight hours of classes on Mondays, 
OL,12,Gexceeding the legally-mandated limit by
OL,13,Gone hour.                              
OL,14,K                                       
OL,15,BFinland and six other EU states want   
OL,16,Bfaster visa ban on Russian athletes    
OL,17,G"It is simply impossible to separate   
OL,18,Gsports and geopolitics," the seven     
OL,19,Gcountries pushing for the ban said.    
